all()` aggregates dashboard + domain files (line 319); `latest_health_report()` surfaces the daily health check (line 388).\n- Task lifecycle operations: `mark_done`, `mark_undone`, `add_task`, `capture_inbox`, `link_task`, `edit_task`, `edit_project`, `cancel_task`, `save_for_later`, `restore_task` (lines 3908â€“4319).\n\n**Capabilities â€” R&D control surface (v2/v3/v4) rendering**\n- Project rendering helpers: `render_status_line_html`, `render_project_tile_html`, `render_projects_view_html`, `render_kanban_html`, `render_grass_board`, `render_lane_sessions`, and the large `render_project_window_html` (line 1856, spanning to ~3646) â€” the cockpit project window.\n- Effort/rollup rendering: `_gather_project_efforts`, `_render_effort_card`, `render_header_rollup_html`, `render_cost_rollup_html`, `render_deliverables_html` (lines 1348â€“3885).\n- WebSocket support is hand-rolled per RFC 6455: `ws_accept_key`, `encode_text_frame`, `encode_close_frame`, `encode_pong_frame`, `decode_frames` (lines 463â€“633) â€” used for the ConPTY terminal transport.\n- Traversal-safe static asset routes: `anchor_term_asset`, `xterm_asset`, `brand_asset`, guarded by `_unsafe_path_seg` (lines 634â€“750).\n\n**Capabilities â€” HTTP API (`AnchorHandler`, line 6270)**\n- **GET** routes include `/api/status`, `/api/version`, `/report/`, `/summary/`, `/artifact/`, `/project/`, favicon/icon assets, KaTeX/xterm/brand static prefixes, and R&D read endpoints: `term_stream`, `term_ws`, `term_stream2`, `handoff_proposal`, `session_summary`, `session_doc_roles`, `project_rollup`, `term_sessions`, `rnd/projects`, `dir_browse`, `tail`, `jobs`, `previews` (lines 6681â€“7126).\n- **POST** routes include core task ops (`/api/done`, `/api/undone`, `/api/add`, `/api/capture`, `/api/edit_task`, `/api/edit_project`, promote/demote task+project, `/api/cancel`, `/api/save_for_later`, `/api/restore`, `/api/heartbeat`) (lines 7176â€“7271).\n- **POST** R&D ops include project lifecycle (`new_project`, `open_pr